OL,3,GNEWSAParades Commission says Orange
OL,4,AOrder Drumcree parade can go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Parades Commission has ruled that
OL,7,Fan Orange Order parade at Drumcree can
OL,8,Fgo ahead
OL,10,FA number of conditions including the
OL,11,Fnumber of participants and the timing
OL,12,Fof the parade have been put in place
OL,14,FThe Parades Commission had been
OL,15,Fdeliberating on whether the parade
OL,16,Fwould be allowed along the mainly
OL,17,Fnationalist Garvaghy Road
OL,19,FBreandan Mac Cionnaith of the Garvaghy
OL,20,FRoad Residents' Coalition said
OL,21,Fresidents are shocked and angry
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
