OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAParades Commission says Orange
OL,4,AOrder Drumcree parade can go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have gathered at the High
OL,7,FCourt in Belfast, where they intend to
OL,8,Fchallenge the decision and politicians
OL,9,Ftell the crowd the hearing will happen
OL,10,Fon Saturday morning at 11am.
OL,12,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill said
OL,13,Fthere is "no reasonable or logical
OL,14,Fbasis" for the decision
OL,16,FDemocratic Unionist Party leader Gavin
OL,17,FRobinson described the decision as a
OL,18,F"significant and long-overdue
OL,19,Fbreakthrough"
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
